          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hungry Eyes</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catraâ€™s death was going to devastate Adora. Bow only hoped grief wouldnâ€™t cripple her in the fight against Horde Prime. He hated himself for being so selfish; he tried to think of anything comforting to say but came up empty.Â And then...wellâ€¦he was not at all sure what happened.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra coughed. â€œHey, Adora." For a heartbeat, she looked genuinely content,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra settles in on Darla.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
